WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.232
My brother is asleep.

2
00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:15.154
I am awake.

3
00:00:15.155 --> 00:00:18.042
His bed is on the top.

4
00:00:18.043 --> 00:00:21.274
Mine is on the bottom.

5
00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:25.987
He is outside the bathroom.

6
00:00:25.988 --> 00:00:29.668
I am inside the bathroom.

7
00:00:29.669 --> 00:00:34.599
His piggy bank is heavy.

8
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:38.628
Mine is light.

9
00:00:38.629 --> 00:00:42.640
His cookie jar is empty.

10
00:00:42.641 --> 00:00:45.961
Mine is full.

11
00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:48.770
His bike is big.

12
00:00:48.771 --> 00:00:51.951
Mine is small.

13
00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:55.014
He is fast.

14
00:00:55.015 --> 00:00:58.298
I am slow.

15
00:00:58.299 --> 00:01:02.327
He is up and I am down.

16
00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:06.934
I am up and he is down.

17
00:01:06.935 --> 00:01:10.881
His jump rope is long.

18
00:01:10.882 --> 00:01:15.299
Mine is short.

19
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.542
But we both love Mom and Dad.

20
00:01:18.543 --> 00:01:23.968
And we are one happy family.
